# Input

```scss
.a {
	box-shadow:
		inset 1px 1px 0 0 red,
		inset -1px -1px 0 0 blue;
	background-position: left top, right top;
	box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 0 0 $red, be-bevel(1px, 2px) blue;
	transition: opacity 1s, color 2s !important;
	#{$p}: a b, c d;
	--#{$p}: a b, c d;
	font-family: a, b, c;
	--x: a b, c d;
	width: fn((a b c), (d e f));
}

@font-face {
	src: url(a.woff2) format("woff2"), url(a.woff) format("woff");
}

@supports (transition: opacity 1s, color 2s) {
	a {
		transition: opacity 1s, color 2s
	}
}

@import url(x.css) supports(transition: opacity 1s, color 2s);

```


# Formatted

```scss
.a {
	box-shadow:
		inset 1px 1px 0 0 red,
		inset -1px -1px 0 0 blue;
	background-position:
		left top,
		right top;
	box-shadow:
		inset 1px 1px 0 0 $red,
		be-bevel(1px, 2px) blue;
	transition:
		opacity 1s,
		color 2s !important;
	#{$p}:
		a b,
		c d;
	--#{$p}: a b, c d;
	font-family: a, b, c;
	--x: a b, c d;
	width: fn((a b c), (d e f));
}

@font-face {
	src:
		url(a.woff2) format("woff2"),
		url(a.woff) format("woff");
}

@supports (transition: opacity 1s, color 2s) {
	a {
		transition:
			opacity 1s,
			color 2s;
	}
}

@import url(x.css) supports(transition: opacity 1s, color 2s);

```
